  "about": [
    "I am <strong>Yulun Wu</strong>, an undergraduate student at <b>Zhejiang University</b> (CS '27), where I <strong>rank 1st</strong> in my department (Major GPA: 4.93/5.0). I am a visiting undergraduate researcher at <b>UC San Diego</b>, advised by <b><a href=\"https://haozhang.ai/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Prof. Hao Zhang</a></b>.",
    "Before diving into AI research, I was active in <strong>competitive programming</strong>, culminating in <strong>3rd place</strong> at <b>the 49th ICPC EC-Final</b>. This experience led me to focus on efficiency and algorithm-system co-design for foundation models.",
    "<strong>My research aims to build efficient AI systems across the full model lifecycle, from architecture and post-training to recursive self-improving (RSI) agents</strong>. In particular, I focus on: <ul class=\"about-list\"> <li><b>Efficient Video Generation</b>: JetDiffusion <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.33268\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[arXiv 2611]</a></li> <li><b>Efficient LLM &amp; LLM RL</b>: PeRL <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2512.23165\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[ICML '26]</a>, JetSpec <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.18394\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[arXiv 2606]</a></li> </ul>",
    "I am currently working on <b>robo-use agents</b> and <b>efficient RSI infrastructure</b> for them, see: ORA <a href=\"https://fastrua.ai/blog/2026-11-code-mode/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[blog]</a>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">ORA-RSI</span> [coming soon]."
  ],
